    }(name='saml', description='The SAML configuration for CustomSSO. Choose between metadataXml and the four manually entered fields: entityId, loginUrl, bindingType, and x509Certificates. If not submitted, the existing configuration is retained. DingTalk and Feishu do not accept this field.'),
